						130100611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100611,
					"content": "嗯…好像沒有看到什麼特別的地方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100612,
					"content": "都是一些很普通的罐裝知識。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130100613,
					"content": "也許是記錄歸寂之庭的罐裝知識數量不多，被他們帶走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100614,
					"content": "#沒關係，我還有一個辦法。{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}們原路返回，而我藏在這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100615,
					"content": "#過一段時間{F#妳}{M#你}們回來跟我會合，應該會有收穫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100616,
					"content": "難怪你讓我帶著定位器…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130100617,
					"content": "他們匆忙撤離，很多貨物來不及帶走，不可能一直這樣放著不管。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100618,
					"content": "確認我們「離開」之後，自然會有人過來收拾。所以要讓定位器離這裡足夠遠，讓他們誤以為自己已經安全。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100619,
					"content": "我明白了！你是想讓我們當誘餌，來騙他們現身！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100620,
					"content": "好吧，我們現在就出發，這裡就交給你啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100621,
					"content": "放心。只要他們敢來，我一定把他們留下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "賽諾"
				}
